REM spooky_skull.duck - a HARMLESS gag that LOOKS sinister.
REM
REM What it actually does: opens Notepad and TYPES text (an ASCII skull &
REM crossbones with a spooky message). That is ALL. It runs no commands,
REM downloads nothing, deletes nothing, changes nothing - it is just
REM characters typed into a text editor you can close without saving. It is
REM a demo to prove HID typing works, nothing more.
REM
REM Targets WINDOWS (uses Win+R to open Notepad). For macOS/Linux, replace
REM the "open notepad" lines with your editor's launch keys (see rickroll.duck
REM for the pattern). Only plug the device into hardware you own/are
REM authorized to test.

DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN notepad
REM give Notepad a moment to open and take focus
DELAY 1800
DEFAULTDELAY 15
STRINGLN I SEE YOU
ENTER
STRINGLN       _______
STRINGLN      /       \
STRINGLN     | ()   () |
STRINGLN     |    ^    |
STRINGLN     |  \___/  |
STRINGLN      \_______/
ENTER
STRINGLN     \\       //
STRINGLN      \\     //
STRINGLN       \\   //
STRINGLN        \\ //
STRINGLN         \X/
STRINGLN         /X\
STRINGLN        // \\
STRINGLN       //   \\
STRINGLN      //     \\
STRINGLN     //       \\
ENTER
STRINGLN I'M COMING FOR YOU!
